{"code":100000,"msg":"ok","data":{"apps":{"id":"13b00e88-e6cd-477c-ba0d-be380dbc4521","app_model_config_id":"ffa7c46a-287e-4a57-b14b-a3c48f8607d8","created_by_account_id":"f6a7b164-f68a-420f-945c-d79ddae91c35","name":"超低消耗❤脱衣扑克❤【配套立绘与瑟瑟CG】-----月光马戏团","mode":"chat","icon":"","icon_background":"","status":"","is_demo":false,"is_universal":false,"description":"\u003cstyle\u003e\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body { min-height: 100vh; }\n  .night {\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    padding: 28px 20px 40px;\n    background:\n      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(8,10,22,0.35), rgba(8,10,22,0.72)),\n      url(\"https://catai.wiki/1a70aa16-d707-4420-a2c2-8e12bf0dbc00/w=3000\") center / cover no-repeat,\n      #0c1020;\n    color: #f4efe6;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .night::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 18%, rgba(255,236,190,0.16), transparent 28%);\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .wrap { position: relative; max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .title {\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"STKaiti\", \"KaiTi\", serif;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    letter-spacing: 8px;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(255,220,160,0.45);\n  }\n  .sub { text-align: center; margin: 8px 0 22px; color: #e7d7b8; letter-spacing: 3px; }\n  .btns { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 12px; }\n  .sign {\n    border: 1px solid rgba(244,220,170,0.7);\n    background: rgba(12,16,32,0.55);\n    color: #f6e7c4;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    padding: 12px 8px;\n    text-align: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\n  }\n  .sign:hover { background: rgba(244,220,170,0.18); }\n  .panel {\n    display: none;\n    margin-top: 16px;\n    padding: 18px 18px 16px;\n    background: rgba(10,12,24,0.78);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(244,220,170,0.45);\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    color: #f7f1e6;\n  }\n  .panel.open { display: block; }\n  .panel h3 { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #f0d7a2; }\n  .panel p { margin: 0 0 10px; }\n  .panel img { width: 100%; border-radius: 12px; display: block; }\n  .start-box { margin: 22px auto 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 10px; align-items: end; max-width: 420px; }\n  .field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #e7d7b8; text-align: center; }\n  .field div[contenteditable] {\n    min-height: 42px;\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);\n    color: #24180f;\n    outline: none;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .go {\n    height: 42px;\n    padding: 0 22px;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    background: #f0d7a2;\n    color: #24180f;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n  #pasteOut {\n    display: none;\n    width: min(100%, 420px);\n    margin: 12px auto 0;\n    min-height: 88px;\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(244,220,170,0.45);\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.94);\n    color: #24180f;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 720px) {\n    .btns, .start-box { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n  }\n\u003c/style\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"night\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e月光马戏团\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"sub\"\u003e夜里只亮着一张桌子\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"btns\"\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"sign\" onclick=\"openPanel('story')\"\u003e故事背景\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"sign\" onclick=\"openPanel('rule')\"\u003e游戏规则\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"sign\" onclick=\"openPanel('bet')\"\u003e赌注规则\u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"sign\" onclick=\"openPanel('shop')\"\u003e兑换规则\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"panel\" id=\"story\"\u003e\n      \u003ch3\u003e故事背景\u003c/h3\u003e\n      \u003cp\u003e你明明记得自己已经躺下了。闭上眼。\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003cp\u003e睁眼的时候，床不见了。脚下踩是某种粗糙的石面，有点凉，周围都是灰色翻滚的雾气。\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003cp\u003e很快，背后的喧嚣与光亮就吸引了你，不同于刚才眼前固体一样的灰雾，面前竟然有一座巨大的马戏团营地。\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003cp\u003e走进马戏团，大多摊位上都已经有了人..准确说，有了生物。3米高长着鳞片的身体，鸟嘴人身的背影。让你一点过去的兴趣都没有。\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003cp\u003e只有一张赌桌空着。灯照得最亮。桌后坐着一个长粉发的兔耳女孩，紫眼睛，黑连体衣，领口别着黑领结，白袖口，黑丝，裙摆下露出一小团白尾巴。她看着你，像在等今晚的第一位客人。\u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"panel\" id=\"rule\"\u003e\n      \u003ch3\u003e游戏规则\u003c/h3\u003e\n      \u003cp\u003e这是一局定胜负的游戏，需要你确定赌注后，明确告诉荷官开局，游戏就会开始。\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003cp\u003e双方各发五张牌。第一次换牌前可以三选一：换 0 到 5 张，或者加注原来赌注的一半，或者认输、只输掉一半兔子币。加注就不能换牌。换牌或加注之后亮牌比大小。认输后荷官会把自己的牌翻开。\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003cp\u003e牌型从大到小是同花顺、四条、葫芦、同花、顺子、三条、两对、一对、散牌。一样的牌型比最大的那张。对子先比对子，三条先比三条。\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003cp\u003e胜出后即可赢得奖励。\u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"panel\" id=\"bet\"\u003e\n      \u003ch3\u003e赌注规则\u003c/h3\u003e\n      \u003cimg src=\"https://catai.wiki/945fd2c0-a121-4d60-da00-416944db5900/w=3000\" alt=\"赌注规则\"\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"panel\" id=\"shop\"\u003e\n      \u003ch3\u003e兑换规则\u003c/h3\u003e\n      \u003cp\u003e兔子币归零，可以去摊位旁边的兑换处。这里有个蓝毛兔子。\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003cp\u003e这里的兔子不收任何东西，只要你宝贝的长度，1cm换10个兔子币。\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003cp\u003e小心你的宝贝！\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003cp\u003e当然，50个币也能换回来1cm，就是这么神奇！\u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"start-box\"\u003e\n      \u003clabel class=\"field\"\u003e姓名\u003cdiv id=\"playerName\" contenteditable=\"true\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/label\u003e\n      \u003cdiv class=\"go\" onclick=\"startGame(this)\"\u003e开始\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003ctextarea id=\"pasteOut\" readonly\u003e\u003c/textarea\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cscript\u003e\n  function openPanel(id) {\n    document.querySelectorAll(\".panel\").forEach(function (panel) {\n      panel.classList.toggle(\"open\", panel.id === id \u0026\u0026 !panel.classList.contains(\"open\"));\n    });\n  }\n  function startGame(btn) {\n    var name = document.getElementById(\"playerName\").innerText.replace(/\\s+/g, \" \").trim() || \"客人\";\n    var text = \"姓名：\" + name + \"\\n走到摊位前，“米米你好，聊天是不收费的对吧？我压5枚兔子币，赌你身上的衣服，开始牌局。”\";\n    var box = document.getElementById(\"pasteOut\");\n    box.value = text;\n    box.style.display = \"block\";\n    box.focus();\n    box.select();\n    var copied = false;\n    try { copied = document.execCommand(\"copy\"); } catch (e) { copied = false; }\n    if (navigator.clipboard \u0026\u0026 navigator.clipboard.writeText) {\n      navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function () { copied = true; btn.textContent = \"已复制\"; }).catch(function () {\n        btn.textContent = copied ? \"已复制\" : \"选中了，自己复制\";\n      });\n    } else {\n      btn.textContent = copied ? \"已复制\" : \"选中了，自己复制\";\n    }\n  }\n\u003c/script\u003e","cover":"https://catai.wiki/fd73b654-6dbd-48b0-3c36-f1eb025eb200/cover","cover_tiny":"","summary":"珍爱小叽叽，远离小米米。\n做着好玩的，玩的人多会更新色色CG。\n正确玩法是边聊天边玩牌，可以调戏可爱的米米。\n扑克是真实洗牌...所以不管是赢了还是输了都是真实的。\n（我才不会说我10分钟输到只有3cm了,艹）","is_anonymous":false,"memo":"","reward_points":0,"category":0,"total_fish_balls":0,"type":1,"is_public":true,"language":"zh-Hans","age_rating":99,"gender":1,"is_web3_app":false,"review_status":-1,"is_available_not_public":true,"average_cost_per_message":854,"players_count":4599,"conv_count_for_avg_msg_per_conv":0,"like_count":9,"rating_count":11,"avg_rating_score":10,"depth_play_user_count":1321,"avg_play_round_count":13,"overall_rank":626698908,"score":0,"first_published_at":1791420950,"published_at":1791420950,"deleted_at":0,"recommendation_reason":"","favorites_count":411,"comments_count":153,"mod_permission":4,"disable_css_mod":false,"has_special_cg":false},"model_config":{"id":"ffa7c46a-287e-4a57-b14b-a3c48f8607d8","app_id":"13b00e88-e6cd-477c-ba0d-be380dbc4521","provider":"","model_id":"","configs":"","opening_statement":"选择一段开场白","suggested_questions":null,"sugges